      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiClient",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiClient.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">High-level API client for the Virtufin Gateway.\nProvides synchronous and asynchronous access to gateway operations.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Configuration constants for the virtufin-api gRPC endpoint that\nother services call. The endpoint is configured via env vars\n(<xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint.HostEnvVar\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and <xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.ApiEndpoint.PortEnvVar\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>) with\ndefaults suitable for local development.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.CloudEvents.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.CloudEvents.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Client.CloudEvents",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.CloudEvents.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Constants for CloudEvents v1.0 metadata keys and standard values.\nUsed by services that publish lifecycle events to the virtufin-api\nvia <code>Pubsub.PublishEvent</code> with the per-service topic name from\nthe publishing service's <code>Configuration/Topics.cs</code>. All values\nare spelled per the CloudEvents v1.0 spec\n(<a href=\"https://github.com/cloudevents/spec/blob/v1.0/spec.md\" sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.CloudEvents.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">https://github.com/cloudevents/spec/blob/v1.0/spec.md</a>).</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Dynamic proxy for the API Gateway. Service names are accessed as properties,\nand backend RPC methods are called dynamically on the returned ServiceClient.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\"><code>client.Gateway.workmanager</code> triggers <xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.TryGetMember(System.Dynamic.GetMemberBinder%2cSystem.Object%40)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\nwhich creates or returns a cached <xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.ServiceClient\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for &quot;workmanager&quot;.\n<code>service.ListWorkers()</code> triggers <xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.ServiceClient.TryGetMember(System.Dynamic.GetMemberBinder%2cSystem.Object%40)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\nwhich returns a callable that invokes via the Gateway's InvokeJson RPC.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Provides service discovery, method listing, invocation, publishing, and streaming capabilities.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.IAsyncStreamEventHandler.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Virtufin.Api.Client.IAsyncStreamEventHandler.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Client.IAsyncStreamEventHandler",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Client.IAsyncStreamEventHandler.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Async callback interface for receiving stream events. Handlers that\nimplement this interface are awaited by <xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Client.GatewayClient.SubscribeAsync(Virtufin.Api.Client.IStreamEventHandler%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable%7bSystem.String%7d%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable%7bSystem.String%7d%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable%7bSystem.String%7d%2cSystem.Threading.CancellationToken)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\npreventing slow handlers from causing gRPC stream backpressure.</p>\n"
    },
