      "Title": "Virtufin.Api.Services.AggregatedReflectionService",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.Api.Services.AggregatedReflectionService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">grpc.reflection.v1alpha.ServerReflection endpoint backed by\n<xref href=\"Virtufin.Api.Services.AggregatedReflectionResolver\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. The Python client and the TUI\nspeak this version.</p>\n"
    },
